"content": "Review the 2005-2014 temperature record and choose the handling route based on whether the period-wide change is large enough to require targeted follow-up or ordinary enough to remain on routine monitoring."
},
{
"ref": "public_task",
"path": "/option_labels/0",
"content": "Route the 2005-2014 temperature change to substantial-change follow-up"
}
],
"claim_kind": "supports_action",
"option_label": "Route the 2005-2014 temperature change to substantial-change follow-up",
"claim": "The visible drop from the 2005 label to the 2014 label represents a large period-wide change, which qualitatively supports routing to substantial-change follow-up, though the exact threshold is not specified."
